  "description": "Ever since her mentor passed away, Siann has despised her own inescapable identity as a cursed witch. Desperate to escape her agonizing lifestyle, she strikes a bold deal with a witch hunter who can absorb mana and transform her into a normal human being. Their arrangement leads to intense, highly intimate physical rituals required to transfer her immensely strong magic. Despite the unusual circumstances, they gradually establish an unexpected domestic bond, sharing breakfast and gentle mornings together. However, Siann isn’t sure how long this peace will last.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13697533), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1746033772), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/witch_hunt), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/witch_hunt), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000077522)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[English](https://www.tappytoon.com/en/book/witch-hunt-m)",
